44. /**
45.  * Cart aggregates lines of products and computes totals. The pricing pipeline
46.  * is fixed at: **subtotal → discount (clamped to [0, subtotal]) → tax on the
47.  * discounted subtotal → shipping (computed against discounted subtotal)**.
48.  *
49.  * The cart never reaches the network or filesystem itself; all I/O is delegated
